              "text": "pallidus, pallida, pallidum — \"pale\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Post morbum puella pallida est. After her illness the girl is pale."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "From palleō. English pallid, and pale through French."
            }
          ]
